                $"Comprehensive overview of key developments related to {query}. Researchers have made significant breakthroughs in this area recently.",
                $"https://example.com/search?q={Uri.EscapeDataString(query)}&r=1"),
            new($"Result 2 for '{query}'",
                $"Detailed analysis of {query} reveals emerging trends and challenges. Industry experts predict major advances in the near future.",
